The "runables" folder has all the player-usable things. The instructions .txt has a link to the web version, and instructions for the linux version. My devlogs can be found in logs.txt, some early concept ideas in ideas.txt, and the code in project.py

I intend to add more cards, enemies, and a longer story in future weeks, so this is just the start, and serves as more of an engine-demo than a final game, but I hope it's fun.
